    "derivation": "L1-optimal constant offset between the measured back-to-back all_reduce medians and the ProtoBridge transfer term at the same message sizes, over the flat region up to 256 KiB; the startup enters the model additively, which the derivation verifies",
    "fitted_against": "all_reduce",
    "fitted_against_because": "a tensor-parallel layer emits two all-reduces and no all-gather, so all_reduce is the operation the shared constant has to serve; the all_gather sweep is recorded alongside as an independent check and sits 6-12 us below the all_reduce curve",
    "name": "per-collective startup",
    "one_value_for_three_bands_because": "the sweep shows no step at the 64 KiB or 4 MiB protocol boundaries; HCCL FullMesh does not reproduce the NCCL protocol bands as distinct startups",
